  "releaseNotes": "0.9.1: Sprint 71 additions — Sub.interval/intervalMs, Cmd.withTimeout, Program.withUpdateInterceptor, RemoteData.mapError, Deferred.viewString, ToastQueue.overlay. CI NETSDK1005 fix for multi-TFM restore. 2,764 tests. Previous: 0.9.0: Complete Elm Architecture (TEA/MVU) with 17+ widgets, SIMD-accelerated double-buffered rendering, flexbox layout engine, ErrorPolicy DU (CrashOnError|LogAndContinue|RecoverWith), TestHarness, Keys.bind, Cmd.fromAsync/fromTask, VirtualList multi-select, TextInput, FuzzyFinder, Viewport, Chart, Toast/ToastQueue, Tabs, Select, theme system, template package.",
